              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maz’ umwami Dariyo avuga ko barondera mu nzu ibīkwamw’ ibitabo vy’ivyabaye, ahabīkwa ibintu vy’igiciro i Babuloni; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.6.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.6.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 6:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2KI.17.6"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Abam 17:6",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "babona umuzingo w’igitabo mu rugo rw’i bgami ahitwa Akimeta, mu gihugu c’i Bumedi; uwo muzingo wari wanditswemw’ ibi, ngw Icibutso: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.6.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.6.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 6:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1KI.6.2"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Abam 6:2",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EZR.1.2"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ezr 1:2",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "mu mwaka wa mbere umwami Kuro ari ku ngoma, uwo mwami Kuro nyene yashinze ibgirizwa ry’ivy’ inzu y’Imana i Yerusalemu, kugira ngw isubire yubakwe, ibe ahantu batangira ibimazi; kand’ amatanguriro yayo bayubake bayakomeze; uburebure bgayo bg’igihagararo bube amatambge mirongwitandatu y’ ukuboko uciriye mu nkokora, amakika na yo abe amatambge mirongwitandatu nyene. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.6.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.6.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 6:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1KI.6.36"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Abam 6:36",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mu kwubaka bakurikiranye imirongo itatu y’amabuye manini‐manini n’umurongo w’ibiti bikiri bishasha; kand’ ibizotangwa kuri yo bize bikūrwe mu ngoro y’umwami. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.6.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.6.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 6:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EZR.1.7"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ezr 1:7",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ",",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EZR.1.8"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "8",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EZR.5.14"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "5:14",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi n’ibintu vy’imbombovu vyākūwe mur’ iyo nzu y’Imana vy’izahabu n’ifeza, ivyo Nebukadineza yari yaranyaze mu rusengero rw’i Yerusalemu, akabizana i Babuloni, ni bisubizweyo bijanwe mu rusengero rw’i Yerusalemu, ikintu cose gisubire mu kibanza cahoramwo, bishirwe mur’ iyo nzu y’Imana.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.6.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.6.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
