              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ico gihe co kuyishikiriza Imana, bātanze amamasa ijana n’amapfizi y’intama amajana abiri n’imyagazi y’intama amajana ane, kandi batangirira Abisirayeli bose amasuguru y’ impene cumi n’abiri, nk’ukw igitigiri c’imiryango y’Abisirayeli kingana, kw ikimazi gitangirwa ivyaha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.6.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
